0..78 Comment "//! A case over the terms of a theory may swap two arguments under a symmetry."
79..82 Comment "//!"
83..157 Comment "//! Two beacons side by side are one term in their two orders. A case that"
158..234 Comment "//! turns the two beacons gives one answer on the two sides of the symmetry."
235..305 Comment "//! The checker admits that case, and the kernel must decide it again."
306..309 Comment "//!"
310..384 Comment "//! The kernel decides the respect of a case by its own conversion, and no"
385..463 Comment "//! trace names a pairing there. At two constructors under a symmetry it tries"
464..532 Comment "//! the written pairing of the two fields, and then the crossed one."
533..536 Comment "//!"
537..553 Comment "//! - see: #8385"
